Subject: virtual-io, virtual-net: replace a listener after a fork

A forked child must listen on a socket of its own rather than the one it
inherited: `replace_std_listener` swaps the descriptor while the guest's
interest handler stays registered, through `Selector::reregister`, which
moves a token's registration to a new descriptor.

